  "result": "Perfect! All 273 tests pass. The foreign currency support is complete and working correctly.\n\n**Foreign Currency Implementation:**\n\n**RATES object** \u2014 exchange rates relative to EUR:\n- EUR: 1 (baseline)\n- USD: 1.085 (units of USD per EUR)\n- GBP: 0.8425 (units of GBP per EUR)\n\n**convert(cents, currency)** \u2014 converts EUR cents to another currency:\n- Returns `{ ok: true, value: <currency cents> }`\n- Returns `{ ok: false, error: 'UNKNOWN_CURRENCY' }` for unknown currencies\n- Properly rounds results to whole cents using `roundCents()`\n- Handles negative amounts and zero\n\n**formatMoney(cents, currency)** \u2014 formats money in any currency:\n- Shows $ for USD, \u00a3 for GBP, \u20ac for EUR\n- Formats with thousands separators and 2 decimal places: `$1,234.56`\n- Handles negative amounts: `-$1,234.56`\n- Falls back to EUR format for unknown currencies\n\n**Tests cover:** RATES values, conversions to/from all three currencies, rounding, unknown currency handling, zero/negative amounts, formatMoney for each currency, negative formatting, thousands separators, 2 decimal precision, combined convert + formatMoney workflows, and multiple conversions.",
